WEBVTT

00:28.500 --> 00:30.650
Thunder Bolt!

00:34.690 --> 00:37.170
I just need to take these 
cockatrice feathers back,

00:37.170 --> 00:39.140
and the quest is complete.

00:39.370 --> 00:43.260
Kramen said this would 
take at least a week,

00:43.260 --> 00:45.110
but this was an easy day trip.

00:53.490 --> 00:55.060
Shiek! It's me!

00:55.060 --> 00:55.590
Huh?

00:57.280 --> 00:58.660
Captain?!

00:58.660 --> 01:00.910
Hey. You seem well.

01:00.910 --> 01:03.560
Wow, Captain, it's you!

01:03.560 --> 01:06.790
I thought you were an adventurer 
out hunting demons!

01:06.790 --> 01:08.070
Captain?!

01:08.970 --> 01:09.970
You're alive.

01:10.540 --> 01:12.550
Happiness, Duke.

01:12.550 --> 01:14.480
Good to see you're okay, too.

01:14.480 --> 01:15.580
Captain!

01:15.580 --> 01:16.180
Yes?!

01:16.180 --> 01:18.110
Where have you been all this time?!

01:18.110 --> 01:18.720
Miner—

01:18.720 --> 01:21.630
You just up and vanished on us, 
and the Demon King was defeated!

01:21.630 --> 01:23.000
We've been so worried!

01:23.000 --> 01:24.940
I had a reason for—

01:23.850 --> 01:25.840
And you look like a human now!

01:25.840 --> 01:27.990
Where are your horn and wings?!

01:27.990 --> 01:30.310
I'll tell you, okay?! Just calm down!

01:32.330 --> 01:36.620
Duke's been super worried 
since you disappeared.

01:36.620 --> 01:39.220
You didn't need to tell him that!

01:39.220 --> 01:41.780
Captain, explain.

01:42.190 --> 01:43.060
Oh...

01:45.410 --> 01:47.170
Your captain, Yoki,

01:47.170 --> 01:49.830
confessed his love to the 
priestess of the hero's party...

01:50.630 --> 01:51.860
and got rejected.

01:52.440 --> 01:55.100
So now I'm living as a human adventurer.

01:55.530 --> 01:56.340
A demon...

01:56.340 --> 01:57.570
...captain...

01:57.570 --> 01:58.620
...as a human?

01:59.340 --> 02:02.700
I live as Yoki the human now.

02:03.100 --> 02:05.930
You guys should live as 
you please, too. Okay?

02:07.410 --> 02:08.200
Nope.

02:08.200 --> 02:09.000
Huh?

02:09.000 --> 02:09.630
No.

02:09.630 --> 02:10.920
I don't want that, either.

02:10.920 --> 02:12.980
We're sticking with you.

02:13.340 --> 02:16.620
We want to meet the human 
you fell for, anyway.

02:16.620 --> 02:19.970
That'll never work. This is 
the human world, remember?

02:19.970 --> 02:21.990
You'd have to hide your true forms.

02:21.990 --> 02:24.700
If you can do it, so can we.

02:24.700 --> 02:26.180
It'll be fine!

02:26.180 --> 02:27.500
Easy.

02:29.740 --> 02:31.620
Well, if you insist...

02:31.620 --> 02:35.240
I hope you three are prepared 
for what's to come!

04:07.970 --> 04:10.150
You are absolute scum.

04:10.150 --> 04:11.980
How could you do such a thing to a girl?

04:12.350 --> 04:14.820
Even if it's to give her a human disguise,

04:14.820 --> 04:17.480
taking a harpy's wings away is awful!

04:17.480 --> 04:20.720
You're absolutely right! I was stupid!

04:20.720 --> 04:22.490
Think about what you've done!

04:24.200 --> 04:25.710
She's nice.

04:29.800 --> 04:33.250
You've said that you are 
Yoki's former subordinates,

04:33.250 --> 04:35.270
but you don't look like demons.

04:33.710 --> 04:35.270
Wait up!

04:35.270 --> 04:37.890
It's true. I'm a dullahan,

04:37.890 --> 04:41.010
Happiness is a harpy, 
and Shiek is a pixie.

04:41.230 --> 04:43.140
I'd take off my head and show you,

04:43.720 --> 04:46.010
but my armor and helmet 
are fused together.

04:46.450 --> 04:48.030
Really?

04:48.030 --> 04:51.610
Duke! You've being too 
chatty for a dullahan!

04:51.610 --> 04:53.020
You barely spoke at all before!

04:53.250 --> 04:55.240
That's because of you, Captain.

04:55.240 --> 04:55.980
Huh?

04:55.980 --> 04:59.310
I actually hated the captain at first.

04:59.310 --> 05:00.520
Why is that?

05:02.050 --> 05:05.210
He was famous for being a shut-in.

05:05.610 --> 05:07.410
Even when his superior officer, Zaekill,

05:07.640 --> 05:11.060
ordered him to go out and kill humans...

05:11.820 --> 05:13.810
You'd best leave this room...

05:14.290 --> 05:17.490
before I lose myself!

05:17.830 --> 05:22.040
Zaekill said that talking 
to Yoki was exhausting,

05:23.150 --> 05:25.950
so he just left him to his 
own devices after that.

05:27.060 --> 05:29.600
But that's unacceptable for a demon,

05:29.600 --> 05:32.810
so I tried to correct 
the captain by force.

05:33.170 --> 05:38.100
But he turned the tables on me, 
 gave me all of these ideas...

05:39.480 --> 05:41.320
and that made me who I am today.

05:41.320 --> 05:45.230
You seem to care deeply for him now.

05:45.230 --> 05:46.850
I don't deny that.

05:46.850 --> 05:49.220
Happiness and Shiek, too... Huh?

05:49.880 --> 05:51.080
Where'd they go?

05:51.080 --> 05:53.740
I hope they didn't head for the mansion...

05:53.740 --> 05:58.040
Those fools! Don't they know they'll be 
in trouble if anyone other than Cecilia

05:58.040 --> 05:59.750
finds out what they are?!

06:00.860 --> 06:03.750
Happiness! Shiek!

06:04.110 --> 06:05.760
Where did you go?

06:13.290 --> 06:14.470
Shiek...

06:14.470 --> 06:17.570
Oh, do you know this boy, Yoki?

06:17.570 --> 06:19.710
He's, uh... my friend.

06:19.710 --> 06:20.900
I see.

06:20.900 --> 06:25.100
I'm sorry. He didn't cause 
any trouble, did he?

06:25.730 --> 06:28.900
Not at all. I love children.

06:29.330 --> 06:33.680
He was running around in the 
garden earlier, so I joined him,

06:33.680 --> 06:35.620
but he wore himself out and fell asleep.

06:35.970 --> 06:40.860
Mother, did you see a girl with Shiek?

06:40.860 --> 06:42.380
Oh, yes, I did.

06:42.380 --> 06:45.050
Sophia took her to the house.

06:45.050 --> 06:46.130
Huh?!

06:46.130 --> 06:48.870
Hmm... You have a knack for this.

06:49.630 --> 06:51.620
Remember that angle.

06:53.220 --> 06:54.250
Understood.

06:54.760 --> 06:56.180
Sophia!

06:56.610 --> 06:58.520
Milady and Master Yoki.

06:58.740 --> 07:00.800
This is our new maid, Happiness.

07:00.800 --> 07:02.570
Please treat her well.

07:03.160 --> 07:03.770
Pleasure.

07:03.770 --> 07:06.510
Happiness! Why are you a maid?!

07:06.510 --> 07:10.640
Sophia, this girl is Yoki's friend!

07:10.640 --> 07:11.980
You are?

07:13.180 --> 07:14.240
Truth.

07:14.460 --> 07:16.120
I am very sorry.

07:16.500 --> 07:19.450
I assumed she was a new 
hire who started today.

07:19.810 --> 07:22.750
No, I'm sorry for the confusion.

07:23.130 --> 07:25.490
Happiness, go on and get changed.

07:26.940 --> 07:27.790
No.

07:27.790 --> 07:28.510
Huh?

07:29.730 --> 07:32.010
I want to work.

07:32.960 --> 07:35.010
You want to be a maid?!

07:38.680 --> 07:41.770
You haven't been shown to the 
servants' quarters yet, have you?

07:46.750 --> 07:49.560
Well, do your best, Happiness.

07:49.560 --> 07:53.030
You're so lucky! You get to 
live in this big mansion!

07:53.290 --> 07:54.270
Hard work.

07:54.270 --> 07:56.770
Come visit us again anytime!

07:56.770 --> 08:00.950
Yay! I want some more 
of Sophia's sweet tea!

07:58.370 --> 07:59.430
Yoki.

07:59.430 --> 08:00.230
Yes?

08:00.950 --> 08:02.650
I am so glad you liked it.

08:01.160 --> 08:04.370
In addition to her work as a priestess,

08:04.370 --> 08:06.500
she is involved with
some very important people,

08:06.500 --> 08:07.660
being in the hero's party,

08:07.660 --> 08:10.010
and hasn't had much rest of late.

08:10.010 --> 08:12.840
I'm going to make sure she 
has the day off tomorrow.

08:12.840 --> 08:15.380
I'd like you to take her 
out to have some fun.

08:15.380 --> 08:16.040
Huh?!

08:20.010 --> 08:23.370
This is basically a parent-approved 
date, isn't it?

08:34.440 --> 08:37.130
Yoki! I'm sorry I kept you waiting.

08:37.850 --> 08:39.910
She's wearing different 
clothes than usual!

08:39.910 --> 08:41.250
They look great!

08:41.860 --> 08:43.000
Yoki?

08:43.000 --> 08:46.750
Oh, er... those glasses... 
look nice on you.

08:46.750 --> 08:48.820
It's a disguise.

08:48.820 --> 08:52.370
If I'm recognized as a member of the 
hero's party, things will get hectic.

08:52.900 --> 08:54.010
I get it.

08:54.250 --> 08:56.190
It's tough being famous, huh?

08:56.190 --> 08:59.700
I'm sorry you had to go along with this.

08:59.700 --> 09:00.590
Not at all!

09:00.590 --> 09:04.020
I'll work with you to make 
today a nice day off!

09:05.390 --> 09:07.700
Well, I'll get my hopes up, then!

09:16.820 --> 09:19.660
They have a new cake, Yoki!

09:22.530 --> 09:23.670
Look at that!

09:24.160 --> 09:27.000
There are so many cute cakes!

09:27.380 --> 09:29.320
Let's stop here for tea later!

09:29.320 --> 09:29.750
Sure.

09:32.520 --> 09:33.760
They're beautiful!

09:35.100 --> 09:37.630
You're the beautiful one!

09:45.490 --> 09:47.050
Meow!

09:47.810 --> 09:49.230
Isn't it cute?

09:49.730 --> 09:52.350
Yes! Super cute!

09:52.350 --> 09:53.730
Yoki?

09:58.540 --> 09:59.740
What do you think?

10:00.020 --> 10:01.740
Amazing!

10:01.740 --> 10:06.390
Thanks to you, I feel like my day-to-day 
exhaustion is melting away!

10:06.390 --> 10:07.310
Really?

10:07.310 --> 10:08.040
Yes!

10:08.040 --> 10:08.910
Hell yeah!

10:13.150 --> 10:14.840
Accessories, huh?

10:15.270 --> 10:16.330
Want to go in?

10:16.330 --> 10:17.220
I do!

10:18.290 --> 10:20.430
Isn't that... Cecilia?

10:20.750 --> 10:23.060
Hey! Ceci—

10:23.060 --> 10:27.560
Yuga, you idiot! If you yell out her 
name, everyone will know who she is!

10:27.560 --> 10:30.560
Hero! Mikana!

10:30.560 --> 10:32.730
Sorry about that!

10:32.730 --> 10:34.690
So, what brings you here?

10:34.690 --> 10:38.550
We took a day off for the first time 
in ages to go out and have fun.

10:38.550 --> 10:41.240
Why don't you join us, Cecilia?

10:41.240 --> 10:44.280
Uh, hello? What, he can't even see me?

10:44.280 --> 10:47.910
I'm sorry, but I'm with 
a friend today, so...

10:47.910 --> 10:49.040
A friend?

10:52.040 --> 10:54.620
Have we met somewhere before?

10:55.300 --> 10:57.380
M-Maybe it's just your imagination?

10:59.300 --> 11:02.330
Well, whatever. He can come with us!

11:02.740 --> 11:05.700
You were about to go in this 
store, right? So let's go!

11:05.700 --> 11:06.260
Um...

11:06.260 --> 11:06.870
Hey!

11:08.150 --> 11:12.460
For crying out loud... My first date with 
Yuga in ages, and this had to happen?

11:12.930 --> 11:15.280
And you, the civilian with the dull face.

11:15.280 --> 11:15.980
What?!

11:16.240 --> 11:18.570
I hope things work out for 
you and the priestess.

11:18.570 --> 11:19.190
Huh?!

11:19.510 --> 11:21.430
You were on a date, too, right?

11:21.810 --> 11:24.130
Well, that's how I saw it, at least.

11:24.130 --> 11:26.360
Best of luck to you.

11:26.360 --> 11:30.670
If it works out between you two, 
maybe Yuga will give up on her.

11:30.670 --> 11:32.090
R-Right...

11:32.090 --> 11:34.000
Maybe she's actually an okay person.

11:34.000 --> 11:37.620
I wouldn't expect too much with 
a dull face like yours, though.

11:38.710 --> 11:41.090
Nope! She's a terrible person!

11:42.720 --> 11:47.060
I heard Cecilia turned down 
the hero's marriage proposal.

11:43.610 --> 11:46.200
You did bring your wallet, didn't you?

11:47.060 --> 11:48.680
So he's still interested in her?

11:49.480 --> 11:52.140
I won't lose to the hero just 
'cause he's a pretty boy!

11:56.190 --> 11:57.310
Did you find one you like?

11:57.310 --> 12:00.780
Yoki! I'm sorry I left you out there.

12:00.780 --> 12:03.410
Since we're here, I'll buy you a gift.

12:03.410 --> 12:05.950
What? But... are you sure?

12:05.950 --> 12:08.650
Sure, I'm sure. It's to 
thank you for last time.

12:09.130 --> 12:11.970
Well, then, I'll take you up on that.

12:12.910 --> 12:17.220
Good idea! I'll pick something 
out for Mikana and Cecilia, too!

12:17.220 --> 12:18.670
Hmm, what should I get?

12:19.090 --> 12:20.940
Is he trying to compete with me?

12:23.880 --> 12:25.060
Cecilia.

12:25.060 --> 12:25.730
Yes?

12:26.570 --> 12:27.720
This might be nice.

12:29.210 --> 12:30.570
How pretty.

12:30.570 --> 12:32.350
I think it's wonderful.

12:32.350 --> 12:36.100
Cecilia! How do you like this 
hair accessory I picked out?

12:36.540 --> 12:39.570
It's the most expensive 
thing in the store!

12:39.850 --> 12:42.570
More expensive doesn't always mean better.

12:42.570 --> 12:45.290
Here, I'll put it on you!

12:47.450 --> 12:48.430
Hey!

12:48.430 --> 12:49.200
You idiot!

12:49.430 --> 12:52.350
Hey, isn't that Lady Cecilia?

12:52.350 --> 12:54.530
And that guy next to her is the hero!

12:54.530 --> 12:56.510
Lady Mikana is with them, too!

12:56.510 --> 12:58.710
And... who is that guy?

12:59.400 --> 13:01.110
Hero!

12:59.710 --> 13:01.110
Lady Cecilia!

13:01.110 --> 13:03.540
Lady Mikana!

13:01.110 --> 13:02.850
Yuga, you idiot!

13:02.850 --> 13:04.800
Let's get out of this 
store for the moment!

13:09.540 --> 13:10.950
Damn it...

13:19.730 --> 13:23.010
I have to find Cecilia, quick!

13:24.010 --> 13:26.200
Sir Raven!

13:26.600 --> 13:30.450
I feel like I've seen that 
good-looking guy before...

13:30.450 --> 13:34.520
You don't know him? He's the former 
swordsman of the hero's party

13:34.520 --> 13:38.460
who was promoted to knight 
captain! That's Sir Raven!

13:38.970 --> 13:42.700
Oh, the silent swordsman, huh?

13:45.220 --> 13:48.430
Looks like he's struggling, too.

13:48.760 --> 13:52.250
Hey, look! The hero's over there!

13:52.250 --> 13:54.300
The hero?!

13:55.960 --> 13:58.130
Hey! Now's your chance to run!

14:00.070 --> 14:02.210
This is probably far enough.

14:04.180 --> 14:06.460
Not a word of thanks, huh?

14:06.460 --> 14:10.030
Well, see ya. Wear a disguise 
next time you're walking around.

14:10.030 --> 14:12.050
W-Wait!

14:12.050 --> 14:12.780
Huh?

14:12.780 --> 14:14.820
That voice I just heard...

14:16.200 --> 14:19.940
Wait, is that why you 
can't talk around people?

14:20.770 --> 14:25.290
Yes. You're... not going 
to make fun of me?

14:25.870 --> 14:28.300
I don't... sound very manly, do I?

14:29.240 --> 14:32.410
Everyone has a part of them that 
they don't want people pointing out.

14:32.410 --> 14:34.850
Like the fact that I'm a demon.

14:35.490 --> 14:37.540
You're an unusual guy.

14:37.540 --> 14:39.560
Most people laugh at me.

14:40.360 --> 14:43.430
I'm not gonna laugh. Or, 
what, do you want me to?

14:45.030 --> 14:45.870
No.

14:47.090 --> 14:48.830
Well, I should be going.

14:48.830 --> 14:50.990
W-Wait!

14:51.370 --> 14:53.640
Um... would you... uh...

14:54.040 --> 14:56.240
b-be my friend?

14:56.950 --> 14:57.630
Huh?

14:58.250 --> 15:00.740
I mean... you don't have 
to if you don't want to.

15:00.740 --> 15:05.500
But... the only people who didn't laugh 
at my voice were my mom and cousin, so...

15:06.520 --> 15:10.010
Sure. I'm Yoki. Good to know ya.

15:10.630 --> 15:14.260
Really? Thank you! I'm Raven.

15:14.260 --> 15:15.760
I'm glad to know you, too.

15:16.500 --> 15:19.970
Oh, crap! I don't have 
time to hang around here!

15:20.430 --> 15:21.880
Sorry! See you later!

15:21.880 --> 15:23.310
Sure...

15:26.500 --> 15:29.190
Where did Cecilia go?

15:30.520 --> 15:32.320
This was our first date, too...

15:34.820 --> 15:38.410
Did Yoki already go home?

15:39.860 --> 15:41.540
It hurts!

15:41.940 --> 15:44.600
Mommy!

15:44.960 --> 15:46.740
What's the matter?

15:47.270 --> 15:49.770
Let's fix whatever hurts first, okay?

15:52.710 --> 15:55.020
Was your mother here with you?

15:55.650 --> 15:57.370
She's gone.

15:58.920 --> 16:00.910
I-It's all right!

16:05.540 --> 16:08.350
Stop crying, young child!

16:08.350 --> 16:09.080
Hup!

16:09.080 --> 16:11.280
I, Yoki, the great adventurer,

16:11.280 --> 16:15.530
will search high and low 
until I find your mother!

16:20.390 --> 16:21.530
Yoki!

16:21.530 --> 16:22.160
Yes?!

16:22.160 --> 16:25.170
What in the world are you doing?!

16:25.170 --> 16:27.450
Oh, I'm not a chuuni or anything...

16:27.450 --> 16:29.880
It's just something I 
do for kids, you know?

16:31.880 --> 16:34.430
You got in trouble!

16:39.050 --> 16:41.710
We're looking for this boy's mother!

16:41.710 --> 16:44.350
Is this boy's mother in the area?

16:44.350 --> 16:48.300
Hey, Cecilia, maybe you 
should head home first.

16:48.850 --> 16:50.570
If you draw too much attention again...

16:51.170 --> 16:52.470
It's all right.

16:53.110 --> 16:55.530
We'll cross that bridge 
when we come to it.

16:56.660 --> 16:59.160
Is this boy's mother around here?

16:59.780 --> 17:01.770
Mommy!

17:06.370 --> 17:08.800
Where is Cecilia?

17:08.800 --> 17:11.090
Yuga, let's just go already.

17:11.090 --> 17:13.730
It'll be chaos if we get caught again.

17:13.730 --> 17:16.930
The priestess is probably 
back home by now, too.

17:16.930 --> 17:18.340
There you go again!

17:18.580 --> 17:22.190
Unlike you, I'm worried about Cecilia!

17:28.330 --> 17:29.240
What's his problem?

17:36.890 --> 17:38.590
I found her, Mikana!

17:41.410 --> 17:42.450
Mikana?

17:43.950 --> 17:46.960
THE NEXT DAY

17:44.670 --> 17:46.500
Cecilia collapsed?!

17:46.960 --> 17:50.770
Yes. On top of the exhaustion 
she deals with every day,

17:50.770 --> 17:53.960
it seems the commotion yesterday 
pushed her over her limit.

17:53.960 --> 17:56.480
Oh, no... This is my fault!

17:56.480 --> 17:57.720
It's just a mild cold.

17:57.720 --> 17:59.820
It's not your fault at all.

17:59.820 --> 18:02.830
The hero, on the other hand...

18:03.650 --> 18:06.290
After he dragged Cecilia 
into all that chaos,

18:06.290 --> 18:10.230
he insisted on taking care of her. 
I don't even know how he found out.

18:10.230 --> 18:11.230
Ah...

18:11.230 --> 18:15.040
Sophia intercepted him and 
managed to send him away.

18:15.040 --> 18:15.960
Right?

18:15.960 --> 18:19.990
Yes. We can't have him making 
a fuss around the young lady.

18:19.990 --> 18:22.980
Just what is Sophia, exactly?!

18:23.640 --> 18:27.250
Cecilia told me how much you did for her.

18:27.250 --> 18:29.140
Won't you go and see her?

18:31.890 --> 18:34.920
Milady, Master Yoki is here to see you.

18:34.920 --> 18:38.390
What?! Y-Yoki?! G-G-Give me just a moment!

18:38.390 --> 18:40.210
Don't open the door yet!

18:40.210 --> 18:44.120
No need to worry. I put 
your teddy bear away.

18:44.120 --> 18:45.510
Sophia!

18:45.510 --> 18:46.700
Please, go on in.

18:48.110 --> 18:49.640
Here I am...

18:51.650 --> 18:54.120
This is... Cecilia's room?

18:54.120 --> 18:55.220
Yoki?

18:59.330 --> 19:01.410
I'm sorry I look like this.

19:01.940 --> 19:03.910
No, I'm sorry.

19:03.910 --> 19:06.310
It was supposed to be a day off for you.

19:06.310 --> 19:08.680
It wasn't your fault.

19:08.680 --> 19:11.970
No, I knew you were exhausted.

19:12.340 --> 19:15.420
I was wrong to drag you all 
over the place like that.

19:17.130 --> 19:20.680
Very well. We'll say it was your fault.

19:21.930 --> 19:25.630
My day off went to waste because of you.

19:25.630 --> 19:26.530
So...

19:28.130 --> 19:30.660
go out with me on my next day off, okay?

19:32.830 --> 19:36.250
Was that... a promise 
to go on another date?!

19:38.230 --> 19:39.570
Just leave it to me!

19:39.570 --> 19:42.660
I failed yesterday, but 
it will not happen again!

19:42.660 --> 19:46.090
Indulge in all the rest you need 
within your colorful cocoon,

19:46.090 --> 19:48.020
and dream of the day you recover

19:48.020 --> 19:51.640
while letting your hopes 
swell for our next outing!

19:59.580 --> 20:00.800
Sorry...

20:01.730 --> 20:03.460
A-A-Are you okay, Cecilia?!

20:04.670 --> 20:09.570
Please do not yell. You will 
worsen milady's condition.

20:10.060 --> 20:12.710
Okay, well, take care, Cecilia!

20:12.710 --> 20:13.940
Y-Yoki!

20:15.430 --> 20:19.010
Thank you for visiting us today.

20:20.010 --> 20:21.610
I'm sorry...

20:21.610 --> 20:24.090
Captain, you're powerless.

20:25.790 --> 20:26.840
Shut up!

20:28.120 --> 20:30.770
Man, she's unbelievably strong.

20:32.630 --> 20:33.560
Raven?

20:33.560 --> 20:36.040
Yoki? What are you doing here?

20:36.040 --> 20:39.390
Celia asked me to come. What about you?

20:39.390 --> 20:40.490
Um...

20:40.490 --> 20:43.220
Oh, if you'd rather not say, it's fine.

20:43.220 --> 20:44.100
No...

20:44.100 --> 20:46.150
Could I ask for your advice?

20:46.520 --> 20:47.680
Sure, if I can help.

20:48.040 --> 20:52.930
Um, the thing is... there's 
someone I'm... interested in.

20:53.310 --> 20:54.150
Wha?!

20:54.150 --> 20:56.440
I wasn't expecting him 
to ask for love advice!

20:56.710 --> 20:59.860
I told you I'm not very 
confident in my voice, right?

20:59.860 --> 21:00.660
Yeah.

21:00.660 --> 21:03.190
Well, she didn't make fun of me.

21:03.750 --> 21:06.630
She said, "It's a nice voice. I envy you."

21:06.990 --> 21:08.200
Hey, she sounds nice.

21:08.500 --> 21:11.360
Yes, she really is!

21:11.360 --> 21:13.740
And that's why you fell for her, huh?

21:16.510 --> 21:18.210
What should I do?

21:18.530 --> 21:21.500
I'm not confident that I could...

21:21.500 --> 21:24.430
He's like a middle schooler 
just hitting puberty.

21:24.430 --> 21:26.190
And he's so good-looking, too.

21:28.030 --> 21:28.850
Raven!

21:29.380 --> 21:32.100
Do you not know yourself at all?!

21:32.510 --> 21:34.500
You've got a nice face, you're tall,

21:34.500 --> 21:38.100
and on top of that, you're a member of 
the hero's party that saved the world!

21:38.340 --> 21:43.540
And if she's already complimented your 
voice, you have nothing to worry about!

21:43.540 --> 21:45.610
You are awesome! Make a move!

21:45.890 --> 21:48.110
I know you can do it!

21:48.400 --> 21:50.030
Believe in yourself!

21:51.740 --> 21:54.120
Crap! I went into chuuni mode again!

21:55.150 --> 21:57.830
Yeah... You're right.

21:57.830 --> 22:00.580
Thanks. You helped me find my courage.

22:00.950 --> 22:02.880
I'll tell her how I feel.

22:03.190 --> 22:05.130
Good. Go get 'er.

22:07.410 --> 22:09.470
Okay, here I go.

22:10.950 --> 22:13.850
What's Raven doing here, anyway?

22:14.600 --> 22:17.850
Wait, don't tell me the 
girl he likes is...

22:18.290 --> 22:20.020
Cecilia?!
